This program requires a python environment of version
>= 3.10. You can check your python version running
'python --version' in any terminal.

The program also requires the pyvips runtime, which
is contained in the apt package libvips42 that can be
installed running 'sudo apt install libvips42' in any
terminal.

To use the core script 'anime-ultrascale.py', the
python packages specified in "requirements.txt" have
to be installed.

To use 'anime-ultrascale' as a program available in
any terminal, open a terminal at the current location
and run 'chmod +x install.sh; source install.sh'.
